["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 128: Early Sufism tasawwuf fana antinomianism mihna al-Malamatiyya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-litandhist-苏菲主义不是低配版伊斯兰-是哈里发国的反弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae099525368458ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文學與歷史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>蘇菲主義不是低配版伊斯蘭，是哈里發國的反彈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲東方學家把蘇菲主義說成橫跨歐亞的神秘主義，現代西方推廣者稱它是「愛、和諧與美」的訊息——但它的根是徹底伊斯蘭的，與最初幾個哈里發國的文化史不可分割。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊斯蘭教</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇菲主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1101 - Aug 15 2026 BFI (beamforming feedback information) LUCA (last universal common ancestor) Balmer break CSA (community supported agriculture)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-skeptics-wi-fi-信号能认出你-而且不用你带手机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>Wi-Fi 信號能認出你，而且不用你帶手機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wi-Fi 5 起設備回傳的 BFI 是明文，誰在射頻範圍內架個接收器就能讀到；靠人體擾動信號識別個人，實驗準確率最高 99.5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">隱私安全</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1348: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MMR ACIP lyophilized PICO sterile insect technique RIG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-twiv-行政令里的谎言-拆mmr与汽水比喻都是伪科学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">55:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>行政令稱疫苗如汽水，拆MMR增針數：每句都是謊言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「金標準」行政令裡每句話都被稱為謊言：拆開MMR增加針數、疫苗如汽水、Merck拒絕，CDC新局長將面臨站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">MMR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 265: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 2 The Omega Point omega point Church principle Kardashev scale unitarity CCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-tokcast-宇宙的终点不是热死-而是被无限次驾驶回正轨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>宇宙的終點不是熱死，而是被無限次駕駛回正軌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tipler 的 omega point 理論被他自己誇張的宗教主張毀掉了，但 Deutsch 說裡面有一個有價值的核心：宇宙必須被持續駕駛，才能在有限時間裡完成無限計算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙學</span><span class=\"tag\">物理哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"361: Bacteria and Colon Cancer Recurrence bowel prep collagenase type IV pilus MAT protein\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-thisweekinmicr-大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠-可能恰好在替促癌细菌做筛选/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b2f5ae26988f1a6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸，可能恰好在替促癌細菌做篩選</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸本為預防感染；可復發者腸道里的耐藥菌對它無動於衷，手術日細菌總量反而是非復發者的23倍。清腸也許正是在為未來的復發做篩選。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">結直腸癌</span><span class=\"tag\">腸道菌群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"492 劉怡、于傑談保羅·沃爾克與現代美聯儲制度的形成 Triffin dilemma Bancor Eurodollar market Volcker shock\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cn2aa250-美联储不是天生精密-它该干什么到1970年代还在摸索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲不是天生精密：它該幹什麼到1970年代還在摸索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲主席在1970年代前連該幹什麼都說不清，總統直接下令降息保就業。沃爾克把利率推到超過20%硬扛通脹，也立起了「主席只看通脹和失業」的現代模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">通貨膨脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky Eating &amp; Food Guilt with Jennifer Anderson embodied independence hyper-palatable foods PSAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-raisinggh-挑食焦虑的解药-不评判-不奖励-甜点也是普通食物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9372f4ec9923f201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>挑食焦慮的解藥：不評判，不獎勵，甜點也是普通食物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子與食物的關係不取決於吃沒吃某樣東西，而在家長是否把食物分成好壞、是否用甜點當獎勵、是否允許自己按孩子的真實需要餵養；挑食信號越早識別越容易改變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童餵養</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why straight dating feels bleak heteropessimism hopeful pessimism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-grayarea-异性恋悲观主义-直女困境的真实与表演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d1e3cbb8f9e58a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>直女約會悲觀不是矯情，是政治倒退與經濟依附</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Jones 認為，直女對約會男性的尷尬與悲觀，既是真實感受也是表演，背後是政治倒退、經濟依附與社交媒體強化的複雜現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">異性戀悲觀主義</span><span class=\"tag\">性別政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Historic El Niño Is Coming That Could Cost the World Trillions ENSO Teleconnection RONI Level effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-oddlots-厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击-而是永久性增长损失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>厄爾尼諾不是短期衝擊，而是永久性增長損失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">厄爾尼諾不只是短期天氣衝擊，研究顯示它會永久壓低經濟增長軌跡，一次強厄爾尼諾五年內可造成數萬億美元損失，且我們並未適應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lindy Teammate: Flo Crivello on Multiplayer Agents, Memory &amp; Why He&#x27;d Ban the Chinese Models He Uses hydration context bucket centary tree TOON hypothesis driven retrieval per-user LoRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cogrev-lindy-全线跑在-deepseek-上-创始人主张封禁中国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde4d0762bd9b4a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>Lindy 全線跑 DeepSeek，創始人卻主張封禁中國模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flo Crivello 說 Lindy 的 agent 現在整條鏈路的 driver 就是 DeepSeek，而他同時主張全行業一起被禁——因為競爭對手會用，他就不得不用，寧願協調解決這個囚徒困境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 記憶</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"SK hynix and the HBM Revolution HBM TSV TC-NCF MR-MUF HBM-PIM ADR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-asianometry-sk-hynix-靠-hbm-翻身-客户战略赢过周期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/143ca5977a616036-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>SK hynix 翻身靠的不是 HBM 技術，而是客戶關係</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SK hynix 的翻身不是押中 HBM 技術，而是押中客戶關係與長期投入；Samsung 押注 PIM 邊緣推理，恰好把 ChatGPT 時刻的唯一供應商位置讓給了對手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Chess.com Teaches US About Superhuman Capabilities, with CEO Erik Allebest Stockfish Leela Chess Zero mittens bot ELO secondary\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-nopriors-ai-让国际象棋变无聊后-又让它更好看了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdff3faf801808d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓國際象棋變無聊後，又讓它更好看了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Stockfish 時代棋手模仿完美引擎，比賽變得沉悶；神經網絡引擎下出激進非常規的棋，反而把人類棋力推得更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國際象棋</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 與人類技能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chelsea Finn: This is the State of the Art in Robotics compositional generalization subgoal image time-to-success RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ycsp-机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才-组合泛化已有强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04a76cf95c327656-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>機器人單模型開箱打平微調專才，組合泛化已有強證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機器人單模型開箱追平微調專才，尤其能在從未見過的機械臂上組合泛化，這都依賴用提示詞馴服低質異構數據；瓶頸正在轉向可靠性、速度和物理分發。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"We Solve the 49ers Viral Conspiracy Theory milligauss deep story\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-sciencevs-变电站不背这口锅-49人队伤病阴谋论被拆穿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>49人隊傷病怪變電站？劑量差40倍，數據也不支持</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宣稱變電站電磁波導致49人隊傷病狂潮的陰謀論，被輻射專家和傷病數據庫逐條證偽：劑量遠低於安全線、引用的論文不合格、2014年擴建的是另一座電站，數據也顯示他們並非最慘。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NFL</span><span class=\"tag\">傷病數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transcranial magnetic stimulation and the future of psychiatry | Corey Keller TMS theta burst stimulation cortical excitability limbic subgenual cingulate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-fromourneurons-tms-治抑郁只有五成有效-卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>TMS 治抑鬱只有五成有效：卡在不懂它怎麼改變大腦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TMS 已進入臨床卻還是「黑箱」，機理不清導致療效停留在 50%。用癲癇病人顱內電極取到神經元的ground truth，下一步是磨出腦電 biomarker，把治療從猜參數變成閉環優化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">TMS</span><span class=\"tag\">神經調控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Bernstein: The Money Decisions That Actually Matter | Rational Reminder 422 hedonic treadmill self-determination theory TIPS ladder hyperscalers Easterlin paradox sinning a little\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-rationalreminder-想给孙辈留财富-范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/473a88561804f746-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>想給孫輩留財富？范德比爾特家族聚會裡沒有一個百萬富翁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">財富傳承幾乎註定失敗：繼承人每代翻倍稀釋、繳稅、攀比消費；真正該做的是趁孩子三四十歲用「溫暖的手」把錢給出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富傳承</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Coffee Sufis Levant Company Lloyd&#x27;s List Robusta Moka pot espresso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-inourtime-咖啡因催生了近代商业情报网络与社交空间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>咖啡不讓人醉，反而催生了近代商業情報網絡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">咖啡最早為蘇菲派祈禱提供清醒；它不讓人醉，反而讓人長談，於是咖啡館成為商業情報交換所，進而通過奴隸種植園和品牌化重塑全球經濟。今天關於拿鐵的爭論，仍寫在這段五百年的歷史裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tag\">商業史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: How to Optimize Female Hormone Health for Vitality &amp; Longevity | Dr. Sara Gottfried SHBG CGM PCOS FDG PET HPA axis CAC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-huberman-女性激素真相-睾酮流失与围绝经期脑代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1ac1c82ed5e5947-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>女性睪酮每年降1%，圍絕經期大腦代謝降20%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性應在 20 多歲建立激素基線，睪酮每年約降 1%；口服避孕藥在降卵巢癌風險的同時可能讓陰蒂縮小最多 20%；圍絕經期大腦葡萄糖代謝平均降 20%，潮熱是疾病信號而非小麻煩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性激素</span><span class=\"tag\">睪酮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trucking Is Booming Again, And Drivers Aren&#x27;t Happy About It non-domiciled CDL ELD (electronic logging device) freight broker FMCSA safety rating spot vs contract rate owner operator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-oddlots-这轮卡车运价上涨来自供给被砍-不是需求回来了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>卡車運價暴漲不是需求回來了，是供給被執法砍掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英語能力執法、non-domiciled CDL 收緊和最高法院經紀商責任判決同時抽走運力，把三年低谷終結的不是貨量回升，而是入行門檻被結構性抬高——下一次需求爆發時市場已無法像 COVID 那樣迅速補供給。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卡車運輸</span><span class=\"tag\">監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The blatant betrayal that erased the Tupperware queen from history subversive domesticity burp Wonder Bowl Jubilee\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-throughline-特百惠女王遭公然背叛-被美国历史抹去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6899c998b8f2c10a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>特百惠女王被解僱後，公司埋掉了她的書</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Brownie Wise 用「家庭主婦聚會」把特百惠變成美國國民品牌，卻因名氣蓋過發明家而被解僱、銷燬生平記錄，直到 2016 年公園命名才被官方承認。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">銷售革命</span><span class=\"tag\">女性職場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"LLMs and the economics of Evil, Inc., with Manish Goregaokar BEC money mule AML Regulation E desk name supply chain attack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-complexsys-大模型把骗局工业化-单点登录成了总开关/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/03fbe8332bb0a87a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>大模型把騙局工業化，單點登錄成了總開關</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當偽造面試、監控郵箱、合成語音的成本趨近於零，任何人的 SSO 賬號都可能被悄無聲息接管；銀行讓誰承擔損失，比教會用戶識別釣魚更關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">反詐騙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Romulus &amp; Remus Rex Pomerium Casa Romuli Lupa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ancients-罗马人清楚建城神话是虚构的-但照样当外交工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9395e3e4c90e300-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬人明知建城神話是假的，卻拿它當外交工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬的起源神話不是刻在石頭上的信史，而是羅馬人用來談判、整合異族和消化內戰的彈性敘事；考古證據甚至與 753 年建城說直接衝突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">神話政治學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"696. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: Killing the Queen of Scots (Part 6) Bond of Association Act for the Queen&#x27;s Safety presence chamber Star Chamber cipher\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-restishistory-玛丽之死背后的真博弈-伊丽莎白想要暗杀-不想签字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>伊麗莎白想暗殺瑪麗，卻被迫簽字處決</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊麗莎白一世不想公開處決瑪麗，只盼有人按《聯合盟約》私下殺她；樞密院堅持法律程序，最終在女王簽字後仍違背其意願，把死刑令連夜送往福瑟林蓋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊麗莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">瑪麗·斯圖亞特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"150. 對英偉達研究副總裁劉洺堉的4小時訪談：功夫、Cosmos 3、開源世界模型、黃仁勳、你不需要擊敗所有對手 Physical AI World Foundation Model Multimodal Transformer Dual-tower\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-zhangxiaojun-英伟达研究副总裁-模型竞争终局是生态-不是击败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/920e2373c894c74b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達研究副總裁：模型終局是生態，不是擊敗對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉洺堉：模型能力終將趨同，英偉達做開源世界模型不是競爭而是鋪路；物理 AI 的 GPT 時刻未到，但條件正在匯聚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Cosmos</span>\n</div></div></a>"]